## Remediation Checklist

✓ **DONE (Tier 1 - 5 min)**: Replaced ObjectInputStream with JSON/Jackson serialization
⏳ **NEXT (Tier 2 - 15 min)**: If legacy code, add ObjectInputFilter whitelist
⏳ **NEXT (Tier 3 - 30 min)**: Scan dependencies for Commons Collections
⏳ **NEXT (Tier 3 - 30 min)**: Add runtime monitoring for suspicious deserialization
⏳ **NEXT (Tier 3 - 30 min)**: Deploy SAST rules to detect ObjectInputStream usage
⏳ **NEXT (Tier 3 - 30 min)**: Upgrade all gadget chain libraries to patched versions

